OL,3,GNEWSAPlumber pleads guilty to string of
OL,4,Asexual assaults
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plumber has admitted carrying out a
OL,7,Fstring of sexual assaults against five
OL,8,Fwomen.
OL,10,FNigel Rowley, 65 and from Wordsworth
OL,11,FRoad in Daybrook, Nottinghamshire,
OL,12,Fpleaded guilty to 12 counts of sexual
OL,13,Fassault during a hearing at Nottingham
OL,14,FCrown Court on Friday.
OL,16,FHe is set to be sentenced at the same
OL,17,Fcourt on 4 December.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
