OL,3,GNEWSAPlumber pleads guilty to string of
OL,4,Asexual assaults
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Michael Auty KC said the offences
OL,7,F"are serious matters committed in the
OL,8,Fcourse of your work", and said there
OL,9,Fwas "very much a risk" he could be
OL,10,Fhanded a prison sentence.
